Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 11 | Text: 就是眼下你们想去做互联网的
Segment #2   [00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,400] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 7  | Text: 不知道互联网怎么做的
Segment #3   [00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:03,660] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 8  | Text: 其实它这个东西很简单
Segment #4   [00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:04,780] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是流量下变现
Segment #5   [00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:05,780] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 6  | Text: 流量做出来之后
Segment #6   [00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:06,740] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 7  | Text: 匹配项目去赚钱
Segment #7   [00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:07,940] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 5  | Text: 万事开头难
Segment #8   [00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:08,960] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 3  | Text: 0-1
Segment #9   [00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:09,980] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 5  | Text: 我指的不是浅
Segment #10  [00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:11,480] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 7  | Text: 0-1是最难的
Segment #11  [00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,980] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 8  | Text: 因为你要克服种种的问题
Segment #12  [00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:14,460] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 10 | Text: 你从一个萌萌无知的小白
Segment #13  [00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:15,420] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 6  | Text: 到路上到精通
Segment #14  [00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:16,460] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 6  | Text: 到优秀到卓越
Segment #15  [00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:17,480] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 5  | Text: 它是非常难的
Segment #16  [00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:18,760] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 7  | Text: 你们可以先做我的切片
Segment #17  [00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:20,520] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 12 | Text: 就刚才我给他对话交流的这个
Segment #18  [00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:21,020] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 3  | Text: 这个过程
Segment #19  [00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:21,780] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 4  | Text: 把它录下来
Segment #20  [00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:22,700] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 7  | Text: 剪辑好配上字幕
Segment #21  [00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:23,520] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 7  | Text: 你发到互联网上
Segment #22  [00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,920] | Elapsed:  16.98s | Words: 10 | Text: 这个内容它就是天生的报款
Segment #23  [00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:26,820] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为我有方法论
Segment #24  [00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:27,620] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 7  | Text: 我有坚持性的意见
Segment #25  [00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,360] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 13 | Text: 有趋于性的表达和干货的输出
Segment #26  [00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:30,240] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 非常的有逻辑
Segment #27  [00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,180] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 你可以随意清
Segment #28  [00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:31,820] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 1  | Text: 然后
Segment #29  [00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,260] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 7  | Text: 这个我教我可以教你们
Segment #30  [00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,180] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 11 | Text: 哪些话题是观众训练看的
Segment #31  [00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:37,440] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 7  | Text: 然后剪辑了一些技巧
Segment #32  [00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,180] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 5  | Text: 授权给到你们
Segment #33  [00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:38,980] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 5  | Text: 你们可以随便清
Segment #34  [00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:39,940] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 切完之后
Segment #35  [00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:40,920] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 5  | Text: 你们可以卖我的书
Segment #36  [00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:41,720] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 6  | Text: 云云给你们拉满
Segment #37  [00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:42,920] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是眼下你如果没有
Segment #38  [00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:45,340] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 7  | Text: 太多别的事可以做
Segment #39  [00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:46,080] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 就干切片
Segment #40  [00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:47,360] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是我先给你讲好
Segment #41  [00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:48,280] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 6  | Text: 你不要浪费我的时间
Segment #42  [00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:49,480] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是做这个事情
Segment #43  [00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:51,740] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 10 | Text: 你不要想着第二天就可以赚到钱
Segment #44  [00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:53,520] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 10 | Text: 它是有一个积累的过程的
Segment #45  [00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:54,260] | Elapsed:  36.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 任何的事情
Segment #46  [00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:56,040] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 7  | Text: 它都不是你今天做了
Segment #47  [00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:57,060] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 7  | Text: 第二天就一定能赚钱
Segment #48  [00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:58,660] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 8  | Text: 如果你是抱着这种心态
Segment #49  [00:00:58,660 --> 00:00:59,700] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就不要做了
Segment #50  [00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:00,720] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 因为大家对做不起来
Segment #51  [00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:01,940] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 5  | Text: 如果你是想笨着
Segment #52  [00:01:01,940 --> 00:01:03,080] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 3  | Text: 我第一步
Segment #53  [00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:03,960] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 我先留点
Segment #54  [00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:05,840] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 我先剪剪我杜的视频
Segment #55  [00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:07,980] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 7  | Text: 然后我先整点生活费
Segment #56  [00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:08,980] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后慢慢后期
Segment #57  [00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:10,340] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 等我完全可以自己做
Segment #58  [00:01:10,340 --> 00:01:10,920] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 自己张双出
Segment #59  [00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:11,880] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 我在去做自己张双
Segment #60  [00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:12,960] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 5  | Text: 或者说我做个
Segment #61  [00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:13,980] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 我是个宝妈
Segment #62  [00:01:13,980 --> 00:01:14,560] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 我在压梅市
Segment #63  [00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:15,440] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 我顺段的
Segment #64  [00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:16,520] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 8  | Text: 看我平时去体验面
Segment #65  [00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:17,300] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 看我杜的视频
Segment #66  [00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:18,800] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 8  | Text: 顺道的我剪剪视频
Segment #67  [00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:19,300] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 2  | Text: 这样也可以
Segment #68  [00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:20,380] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 流量变现
Segment #69  [00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:21,100] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 3  | Text: 我都讲
Segment #70  [00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:22,440] | Elapsed:  56.66s | Words: 10 | Text: 我会有一个系统性的讲解
Segment #71  [00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:23,760] | Elapsed:  69.19s | Words: 8  | Text: 你们可以上主页粉丝群
Segment #72  [00:01:24,420 --> 00:01:25,260] | Elapsed:  69.19s | Words: 4  | Text: 上粉丝群
Segment #73  [00:01:25,260 --> 00:01:26,260] | Elapsed:  69.19s | Words: 5  | Text: 我讲的细一点
Segment #74  [00:01:26,260 --> 00:01:28,820] | Elapsed:  69.19s | Words: 11 | Text: 到时候我给你们系统性的讲解
Segment #75  [00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:29,860] | Elapsed:  69.19s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是流量怎么做
Segment #76  [00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:30,820] | Elapsed:  69.19s | Words: 6  | Text: 主要扩成变现
Segment #77  [00:01:30,820 --> 00:01:31,760] | Elapsed:  69.19s | Words: 3  | Text: 然后讲解
Segment #78  [00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:32,380] | Elapsed:  69.19s | Words: 4  | Text: 你们听一听
Segment #79  [00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:33,220] | Elapsed:  69.19s | Words: 5  | Text: 你们听一听这个
Segment #80  [00:01:33,220 --> 00:01:34,440] | Elapsed:  69.19s | Words: 4  | Text: 要愿意做
Segment #81  [00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:35,920] | Elapsed:  69.19s | Words: 5  | Text: 就尝试尝试
Segment #82  [00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:36,520] | Elapsed:  69.19s | Words: 4  | Text: 不愿意做
Segment #83  [00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:37,420] | Elapsed:  69.19s | Words: 4  | Text: 那没办法
Segment #84  [00:01:37,420 --> 00:01:38,380] | Elapsed:  69.19s | Words: 4  | Text: 也不要你们钱
